ia-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" version=\"1.1\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4012932/atomcraft\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" target=\"_blank\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" version=\"1.1\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MzUzODIyLnBuZw==/original/ORSnAq.png\" alt=\"Atomcraft\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Atomcraft</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_1085675\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://triplejumpgames.itch.io/atomcraft/purchase\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2803490/Atomcraft/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MzU0MzUyLnBuZw==/original/41kNM%2F.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><br></p>\r\n<p>Atomcraft is a game where you can pick up and place every pixel of the environment. Pixels react to whatever is around them, and you can build vessels and machines to make reactions happen.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><strong><em>DAILY DEVSTREAM ON TWITCH</em></strong>: <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/triplejumpgames\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.twitch.tv/triplejumpgames</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><strong><em>JOIN THE DISCORD!!!</em></strong> <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/triplejump\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://discord.com/invite/triplejump</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<ul><li><em>Upgrade your drill and your tools to dig deeper and deeper into the planet in search of better materials!</em></li><li><em>Smelt ore and perform chemical reactions!</em></li><li><em>Find mysterious artifacts with your artifact scanner</em></li><li><em>Battle strange creatures</em></li><li><em>and repair your spaceship piece by piece!</em></li></ul>\r\n<p><em><strong>This is an early demo of the game</strong></em> - the full game will release in April 2026 and feature additional biomes, creatures, and chemical reactions, as well as new mechanics like <strong>radioactivity</strong>.<br></p>\r\n<p><em>Every element on the periodic table will exist somewhere on the planet, although extracting them from their ores may require some creativity!</em><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIzOTI5NzAxLnBuZw==/original/gcyHYz.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>Mechanical pixels are craftable,&nbsp;such as</p>\r\n<ul><li>conveyor belts</li><li>trapdoors</li><li>heating and cooling elements</li><li>wiring for signal-based machines</li><li>buttons, switches, and sensors</li><li>and even logic gates!</li></ul>\r\n<p>Advanced materials like nitroglycerin require careful construction of a reaction machine to craft them without the materials exploding!</p>\r\n<figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI0MTM3NzYyLnBuZw==/original/Ze%2BLfD.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></figure></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_632143\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"01 September 2026 @ 20:04 UTC\"><span class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> 1 day ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" tabindex=\"0\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" data-tooltip=\"4.92 average rating from 13 total ratings\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"star_value\" content=\"4.9\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 4.9 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 98.46154%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></